      "normalizedSource": "If you access the [`system`](nstimezone/system.md) class property, assign its value to a variable, and clear the cached value for the property by calling the [`resetSystemTimeZone()`](nstimezone/resetsystemtimezone().md) method, the object stored in the variable doesn’t update to reflect the new system time zone.",
